INSERT INTO `wp_comments` VALUES
(1,1,'A WordPress Commenter','wapuu@wordpress.example','https://wordpress.org/','','2026-10-07 00:26:01','2026-10-07 00:26:01','Hi, this is a comment.\nTo get started with moderating, editing, and deleting comments, please visit the Comments screen in the dashboard.\nCommenter avatars come from <a href=\"https://gravatar.com/\">Gravatar</a>.',0,'1','','comment',0,0),
(2,44,'Seth Caldwell','seth-caldwell@quills-customer.com','','','2026-09-29 18:30:51','2026-09-29 18:30:51','This blend is a great everyday coffee for all preferences.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(3,44,'Deborah Richnak','deborah-richnak@quills-customer.com','','','2026-08-11 12:53:04','2026-08-11 12:53:04','I had some hollyhock Quill coffee at a VRBO property and that is why I ordered more. That coffee was not available but wha I ordered had a weird after taste. I would have thought it would be delicious considering it was 50$!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(4,44,'Dony Erwin Erwin','dony-erwin-erwin@quills-customer.com','','','2026-08-03 13:10:00','2026-08-03 13:10:00','It’s a little on the mild side for me. We switched to Night Owl for next month’s delivery. Thanks.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(5,44,'Donna','donna@quills-customer.com','','','2026-06-02 16:14:46','2026-06-02 16:14:46','Amazing so glad we found this place',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(6,44,'Staci B','staci-b@quills-customer.com','','','2026-06-01 03:49:41','2026-06-01 03:49:41','This is currently our favorite coffee! Looking forward to trying your other blends in the future.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(7,44,'Gail S','gail-s@quills-customer.com','','','2026-05-27 21:53:22','2026-05-27 21:53:22','Delicious and does the trick for our morning coffee fix.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(8,44,'Ulzii Delger','ulzii-delger@quills-customer.com','','','2026-04-30 03:47:45','2026-04-30 03:47:45','Great one',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(9,44,'Cheryl Streedain','cheryl-streedain@quills-customer.com','','','2026-03-18 10:02:35','2026-03-18 10:02:35','Such a good \"middle of the road\" blend. To my mind is neither too bold or too mild. Thanks',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(10,44,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2025-12-08 13:30:09','2025-12-08 13:30:09','Excellent !',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(11,44,'Robert Alvey','robert-alvey@quills-customer.com','','','2025-12-04 14:34:13','2025-12-04 14:34:13','We visited a location in Louisville while there for doctor appointments. It was an amazing coffee, and we were very happy. I purchased the inkwell whole bean coffee and started using it. I love it!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(12,44,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2025-11-19 19:24:08','2025-11-19 19:24:08','Roasted to perfection, taste great every time',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(13,44,'Lisa Peters','lisa-peters@quills-customer.com','','','2025-11-19 18:54:16','2025-11-19 18:54:16','It’s our favorite!! We entertain frequently and everyone seems to enjoy this coffee.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(14,44,'Lori','lori@quills-customer.com','','','2025-01-04 17:31:06','2025-01-04 17:31:06','Love this coffee. It’s has the best smooth flavor.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(15,44,'Jessica','jessica@quills-customer.com','','','2023-08-25 19:29:03','2023-08-25 19:29:03','Best daily coffee and always fresh!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(16,44,'Cameron Raulston','cameron-raulston@quills-customer.com','','','2022-05-27 21:15:17','2022-05-27 21:15:17','Inkwell | Signature Blend',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(17,44,'Gary Liebst','gary-liebst@quills-customer.com','','','2022-03-01 18:13:13','2022-03-01 18:13:13','The coffee is delicious as always. Top notch quality.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(18,44,'Ron Shay','ron-shay@quills-customer.com','','','2021-10-05 19:26:32','2021-10-05 19:26:32','Inkwell | House Blend',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(19,44,'Lesley Turba','lesley-turba@quills-customer.com','','','2021-06-08 12:28:16','2021-06-08 12:28:16','Unable to share my thoughts on this coffee as I still have not received the delivery.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(20,44,'Dani','dani@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-28 15:14:34','2021-03-28 15:14:34','It is a very good coffee, second time we bought. It is very mild and easy to drink.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(21,44,'Jeff Schepper','jeff-schepper@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-11 17:00:09','2021-03-11 17:00:09','Inkwell is one of my all time favorites. The night owl that I also purchased is ok.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(22,44,'D.G.','d-g@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-04 16:12:40','2021-03-04 16:12:40','This was one of the sweetest coffees I\'ve ever had. It is one of the few in which the tasting notes really reflect what\'s in the cup. The notes of sugar and vanilla really burst out, with that cherry-like acidity holding the balance. Fantastic brew in any method!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(23,44,'Bryan Beach','bryan-beach@quills-customer.com','','','2021-02-06 17:35:14','2021-02-06 17:35:14','We all know that there are hundreds of delicious coffees out there, but nothing is as satisfying, comforting, and consistent as Inkwell. It\'s like my warm blanket.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(24,44,'Debra Totten','debra-totten@quills-customer.com','','','2021-02-02 21:51:42','2021-02-02 21:51:42','Inkwell is my “go to” coffee. While I enjoy the occasional single source bean, I always come back to Inkwell.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(25,44,'Kavya','kavya@quills-customer.com','','','2020-12-22 01:39:32','2020-12-22 01:39:32','great christmas gift for my bf who is from louisville and was feeling a lil homesick. much love from chicago!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(26,44,'Jason Kirshner','jason-kirshner@quills-customer.com','','','2020-12-17 14:55:38','2020-12-17 14:55:38','I love dark roasts that are bold in flavor. The quills coffee is on the sweeter side with the cherry notes. Other than that, it\'s very strong with nice and dense crema',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(27,44,'Leeore Intrator','leeore-intrator@quills-customer.com','','','2020-12-02 16:14:56','2020-12-02 16:14:56','Inkwell | House Blend',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(28,44,'laurie severson','laurie-severson@quills-customer.com','','','2020-11-30 14:28:27','2020-11-30 14:28:27','My favorite (and only) addiction. Had this while traveling thru Kentucky. Had to find it and order it for home.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(29,44,'Patrick Gallagher','patrick-gallagher@quills-customer.com','','','2020-10-23 15:29:05','2020-10-23 15:29:05','Great Coffee Great Flavor',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(30,44,'Brianne Englert','brianne-englert@quills-customer.com','','','2020-10-20 03:27:25','2020-10-20 03:27:25','One cup is all it took, and we were hooked! Sometimes we would make excuses to drive the hour just to get a cup and buy some beans to take back home. Now we order online to have our favorite cup of Joe on a daily basis. Absolutely, love Quills!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(31,44,'Seth Moore','seth-moore@quills-customer.com','','','2020-10-09 01:16:04','2020-10-09 01:16:04','Hopefully it will be good',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(32,44,'Lori Madison','lori-madison@quills-customer.com','','','2020-09-15 16:30:36','2020-09-15 16:30:36','Love getting my favorite coffee delivered! I appreciate the updates about my coffee order. There is no better coffee around!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(33,44,'Allison','allison@quills-customer.com','','','2020-09-15 12:40:29','2020-09-15 12:40:29','Delicious Coffee!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(34,44,'Susan Olson','susan-olson@quills-customer.com','','','2020-08-31 12:05:43','2020-08-31 12:05:43','We really enjoyed the flavor.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(35,44,'Kadyrii Yusufjon','kadyrii-yusufjon@quills-customer.com','','','2020-07-27 03:25:57','2020-07-27 03:25:57','Great coffee, better than both, Starbucks and Heine Brothers whole bean coffee',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(36,45,'Michael Sego','michael-sego@quills-customer.com','','','2026-05-06 13:38:43','2026-05-06 13:38:43','Coffee was great. One of my fav espresso’s for milk beverages! 😊',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(37,45,'Robert Alvey','robert-alvey@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-15 17:41:43','2026-10-15 17:41:43','I tried the espresso beans in my grinder for my espresso machine and they were amazing. Not wax covered like you get at the supermarket, the smell alone is worth the purchase. Also, the roasting date is on the package, which means a lot and not the \"best used by\".',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(38,45,'Kim Martin','kim-martin@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-15 16:30:40','2026-10-15 16:30:40','Brew recipe works like a charm, 202°, I use 19.5 g in, 48 g out and it is amazing! Now start selling your bourbon caramel please lol :-)',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(39,45,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-13 00:54:05','2026-10-13 00:54:05','Really enjoying these beans. Easy to dial in and makes great lattes.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(40,45,'Donald Schlenbecker','donald-schlenbecker@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-12 22:16:08','2026-10-12 22:16:08','Smoothest, cleanest espresso I have ever had.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(41,45,'Scott Fenton','scott-fenton@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-07 12:00:12','2026-10-07 12:00:12','Makes excellent espresso',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(42,45,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-06 19:17:32','2026-10-06 19:17:32','I really enjoy the taste of the coffee. I would like to order a full pound of the same blend. Can you help me?',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(43,45,'Paul Butera','paul-butera@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-02 01:26:40','2026-10-02 01:26:40','Great espresso roast. Pairs perfectly with milk',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(44,45,'TREVOR','trevor@quills-customer.com','','','2026-08-27 21:49:06','2026-08-27 21:49:06','Its awesome its always made a day or two after shipped super fresh can’t recommend enough',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(45,45,'Olivia Reuter','olivia-reuter@quills-customer.com','','','2026-07-28 14:06:41','2026-07-28 14:06:41','The only espresso we use at home. It\'s perfectly balanced, and consistently delicious!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(46,45,'Seth Caldwell','seth-caldwell@quills-customer.com','','','2026-07-11 01:20:51','2026-07-11 01:20:51','Coffee came, as promised, freshly roasted and full of aroma. The taste is sweet, slightly fruity, and well balanced. Grinding fresh every time allows this blend to shine again and again in each cup brewed. I love Quill’s dedication to their customer base in ensuring high quality beans. I have been ordering this blend for well over a year now and will definitely continue to do so! Thanks, Quills!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(47,45,'TREVOR','trevor@quills-customer.com','','','2026-06-13 19:19:31','2026-06-13 19:19:31','Love that coffee some of the best ive had ordering it all the time now love it',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(48,45,'Donna','donna@quills-customer.com','','','2026-06-02 16:13:29','2026-06-02 16:13:29','Incredible find!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(49,45,'Jeff Mueller','jeff-mueller@quills-customer.com','','','2026-05-13 23:28:39','2026-05-13 23:28:39','Love visiting here when I’m in Louisville! Tried many different beans in our espresso maker and we keep coming back to the Blacksmith, it’s our favorite!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(50,45,'Arthur Simpson','arthur-simpson@quills-customer.com','','','2026-05-04 13:43:00','2026-05-04 13:43:00','Got me up and going',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(51,45,'Michael Rakotz','michael-rakotz@quills-customer.com','','','2026-04-21 03:47:37','2026-04-21 03:47:37','Bag came opened and was poured out in the box mixed with another bag of your coffee. I asked for a refund and never received so 1 star and I’m out a lot of money. I’ve heard great thing la and truly wanted to try your coffees - you need to work on your customer service. Michael Rakotz',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(52,45,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-04-08 12:31:11','2026-04-08 12:31:11','My favorite espresso blender. Rich and aromatic and always freshly roasted.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(53,45,'Sonya Combs','sonya-combs@quills-customer.com','','','2026-03-14 00:11:38','2026-03-14 00:11:38','Bought this to mix half and half with decaf de Cana whole bean......love espressos, but needed to cut back on the caffeine!!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(54,45,'James Barger','james-barger@quills-customer.com','','','2026-03-13 14:22:31','2026-03-13 14:22:31','This is my favorite espresso. I\'ve been to hundreds of coffee shops and Quills stands out among the rest. 10/10!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(55,45,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-02-19 23:14:10','2026-02-19 23:14:10','We love this coffee. It is the best we’ve had since leaving Italy',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(56,45,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-02-04 18:13:57','2026-02-04 18:13:57','Love their coffee!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(57,45,'Mark','mark@quills-customer.com','','','2026-01-31 14:13:12','2026-01-31 14:13:12','Great',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(58,45,'Hilary B','hilary-b@quills-customer.com','','','2025-12-05 14:55:22','2025-12-05 14:55:22','This is one of my favorites for an easy always enjoyable at-home brew. Not acidic, not burnt, excellent even and consistent flavor. It doesn\'t make me work to get a good cup out of it either so it\'s great for a lazy / easy morning but can also be prepared a number of ways. Yes, this espresso blend goes through my coffee maker, aeropress, pour over ... whatever I\'m in the mood for and it\'s always been good.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(59,45,'L.H.','l-h@quills-customer.com','','','2025-11-12 21:28:06','2025-11-12 21:28:06','Best coffee!!!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(60,45,'D Hartman','d-hartman@quills-customer.com','','','2025-11-12 16:35:47','2025-11-12 16:35:47','This coffee roast and blend are truly awesome. So much flavor and subtle notes. If you love lighter body espresso that still holds up in espresso drinks with milk you will not be disappointed! 10 out of 10.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(61,45,'Vic Emond','vic-emond@quills-customer.com','','','2025-11-04 21:40:35','2025-11-04 21:40:35','LOVE this espresso. Best tasting bean out there.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(62,45,'Lauren','lauren@quills-customer.com','','','2024-09-30 22:39:45','2024-09-30 22:39:45','best espresso I have ever had',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(63,45,'Kim','kim@quills-customer.com','','','2023-12-19 22:40:14','2023-12-19 22:40:14','The coffee is amazing',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(64,45,'Amber Good','amber-good@quills-customer.com','','','2022-05-29 20:04:43','2022-05-29 20:04:43','Great flavor',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(65,45,'Quinn Cone','quinn-cone@quills-customer.com','','','2022-05-10 14:11:15','2022-05-10 14:11:15','I received Blacksmith via Trade as a random weekly bean, and immediately created a recurring subscription with Quill\'s. It is now my staple espresso, and can\'t recommend it enough.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(66,45,'Paige Demetriades','paige-demetriades@quills-customer.com','','','2022-04-16 15:59:59','2022-04-16 15:59:59','I have an espresso machine and have searched far and wide for good beans and I haven’t found anything that touches the Blacksmith.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(67,45,'Jonathan Ray','jonathan-ray@quills-customer.com','','','2022-04-07 14:34:24','2022-04-07 14:34:24','Totally worth ordering even when I have tons of local roasters around me! So good!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(68,45,'P Dean Addison','p-dean-addison@quills-customer.com','','','2022-03-22 15:17:17','2022-03-22 15:17:17','This batch seemed like a weaker roast than the previous blacksmith espresso.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(69,46,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-13 22:46:57','2026-10-13 22:46:57','This batch was our most disappointing batch ever given how long we have been getting beans from Quills. These beans had that burn quality that you are simply like, this isn’t our norm but, what exactly happened at the same time. It’s two bags worth of burnt coffee and we are thrilled given the price.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(70,46,'Kristopher Johnson','kristopher-johnson@quills-customer.com','','','2026-07-28 14:13:53','2026-07-28 14:13:53','I visited Louisville in the spring and wanted to share the cold brew with my wife. She loves it too—it’s smooth and flavorful and we love that it’s roasted to order.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(71,46,'Jennifer Burk','jennifer-burk@quills-customer.com','','','2026-07-03 09:53:46','2026-07-03 09:53:46','The coffee is smooth and delicious. It is my new focorote I found on a trip to Louisville.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(72,46,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-03-24 16:40:04','2026-03-24 16:40:04','That’s why I keep buying Southern Gothic and Inkwell !',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(73,46,'Natalie','natalie@quills-customer.com','','','2026-03-16 15:55:29','2026-03-16 15:55:29','One of my favorite coffees and still is so happy i can have it delieverd to me since i moved away from the coffee shop.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(74,46,'Anonymous','anonymous@quills-customer.com','','','2026-02-21 01:17:13','2026-02-21 01:17:13','It’s my go to coffee even after years of trying and exploring',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(75,46,'Faith','faith@quills-customer.com','','','2025-09-10 16:48:42','2025-09-10 16:48:42','This is my favorite coffee ever. I look forward to it every morning',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(76,46,'L','l@quills-customer.com','','','2022-05-16 12:45:21','2022-05-16 12:45:21','Southern Gothic | Cold Brew Blend',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(77,46,'Linda McNutt','linda-mcnutt@quills-customer.com','','','2022-05-10 13:26:03','2022-05-10 13:26:03','I purchased this for cold brew and it was great. I also made a pot of hot coffee with it, and we enjoyed it that way as well.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(78,46,'Melissa Rue','melissa-rue@quills-customer.com','','','2021-12-28 22:32:00','2021-12-28 22:32:00','Amazing!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(79,46,'Brian Gibson','brian-gibson@quills-customer.com','','','2021-12-14 21:52:42','2021-12-14 21:52:42','Excellent blend! Can’t wait to try some more blends from Quills!!!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(80,46,'Tracy Swart','tracy-swart@quills-customer.com','','','2021-11-02 16:24:17','2021-11-02 16:24:17','Heaven in a cup',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(81,46,'Clark Fralick','clark-fralick@quills-customer.com','','','2021-05-29 00:01:47','2021-05-29 00:01:47','This is not BS coffee. Great smooth coffee that loves to be drank.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(82,46,'KSS','kss@quills-customer.com','','','2021-04-15 14:27:08','2021-04-15 14:27:08','More complex than I was expecting. I’m pleasantly surprised.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(83,46,'j. anderson','j-anderson@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-30 19:47:49','2021-03-30 19:47:49','While on a (pre-COVID) road trip, my son and I happened to stop at a coffee shop that served Quills Coffee. I bought a couple of pounds to take home with me. One of the pounds was apparently mostly-forgettable; the other was Southern Gothic. It’s not always available; when we notice that it is, we order some! It’s one of the smoothest, most enjoyable coffees we’ve had.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(84,46,'David','david@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-28 03:46:03','2021-03-28 03:46:03','Tried it based on the tasting notes. This is my new favorite of all the blends offered by quills.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(85,46,'Dyer Lowery','dyer-lowery@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-06 15:58:55','2021-03-06 15:58:55','I originally ordered this coffee because I thought the name was cute. It definitely exceeded my expectations and is my new favorite from Quills!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(86,46,'Steven','steven@quills-customer.com','','','2021-01-19 14:52:41','2021-01-19 14:52:41','A delicious coffee I can drink everyday with any brew method, will definitely order again!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(87,46,'Mark Steingold','mark-steingold@quills-customer.com','','','2021-01-14 01:36:28','2021-01-14 01:36:28','I love this blend...rich taste, smooth, and very satisfying first thing in the morning! A great way to start the day!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(88,46,'Donna Standridge','donna-standridge@quills-customer.com','','','2020-12-27 19:22:18','2020-12-27 19:22:18','Southern Gothic - 12 oz',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(89,46,'Anita Moore','anita-moore@quills-customer.com','','','2020-11-02 04:37:38','2020-11-02 04:37:38','Since I became a coffee drinker later in life, I struggled for a few years to find a coffee I really loved. Southern Gothic is it! Yay! And Quills is delightful to work with. I\'ve been getting coffee by subscription for a over a year now, and I am very happy!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(90,47,'Elise Martin','elise-martin@quills-customer.com','','','2026-06-24 11:54:44','2026-06-24 11:54:44','Deliciously rich flavor from start to finish. My new favorite bean!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(91,47,'Orion','orion@quills-customer.com','','','2026-06-09 12:54:36','2026-06-09 12:54:36','Good fresh beans every time. I got the subscription, and its worth it. Easily the best beans at this price point. Consistent roast, great flavor, reasonable price. Thank you Quills',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(92,47,'David Nation','david-nation@quills-customer.com','','','2026-03-13 15:41:07','2026-03-13 15:41:07','I always drank my coffee weak; until I tasted Quill\'s coffee. Thanks for changing taste for coffee. It\'s a coffee without the bitter taste and contaminants. \"Smooth\" Thanks!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(93,47,'Chris Stamper','chris-stamper@quills-customer.com','','','2026-02-04 21:53:32','2026-02-04 21:53:32','I\'m not usually a dark roast guy but the night owl blend was fantastic. Very smooth and full tasting.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(94,47,'Barb Chunn','barb-chunn@quills-customer.com','','','2026-01-29 02:33:17','2026-01-29 02:33:17','The night owl is our favorite beans. It smells and tastes rich and delicious.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(95,47,'MTNMAN','mtnman@quills-customer.com','','','2025-11-23 14:21:14','2025-11-23 14:21:14','I had visited the quills coffee shop here in Knoxville Tennessee across from restaurant called the Disco chicken. I had looked at the different types of coffee by quills and saw the night owl bag and read the flavor notes. has somebody who enjoys pipe smoking cigars and other artisan flavors need intrigued me to try a cup. I was asked if I wanted drip pour over a French press. as I know French press provides the depth and flavor I chose the French press was the best decision I have made. after that cup of night owl coffee I have since purchased a 2 lb bag and if considered purchasing a 5 lb bag I\'ve been on the hunt for a good dark roast Vienna coffee house is dark horse is a pretty good contender but it\'s still too acidic compared to this. I would highly recommend this.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(96,47,'ALYSON','alyson@quills-customer.com','','','2024-12-13 00:17:53','2024-12-13 00:17:53','My husband’s favorite coffee! Always packaged well with shipping.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(97,47,'Dawn','dawn@quills-customer.com','','','2024-01-16 14:57:37','2024-01-16 14:57:37','Amazing flavor! Did not disappoint.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(98,47,'Kaitlyn Branch','kaitlyn-branch@quills-customer.com','','','2022-04-26 16:17:01','2022-04-26 16:17:01','Quills never fails to provide fresh, delicious coffee for my team and residents! Thank you!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(99,47,'Rebecca Dillon','rebecca-dillon@quills-customer.com','','','2022-03-13 19:14:09','2022-03-13 19:14:09','Night Owl | Dark Blend',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(100,47,'Jose Torres-Vorshirm','jose-torres-vorshirm@quills-customer.com','','','2022-01-15 00:10:49','2022-01-15 00:10:49','The dark chocolate tones with that subtle finish of tobacco at the very end makes me want to open a bottle of scotch at 7am. One of the best dark roasts I’ve had, a pleasant and bold jump start in the morning….',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(101,47,'Alex B.','alex-b@quills-customer.com','','','2021-12-05 13:58:32','2021-12-05 13:58:32','Absolutely love Quills!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(102,47,'ALYSON FAULHABER','alyson-faulhaber@quills-customer.com','','','2021-07-14 23:34:55','2021-07-14 23:34:55','The best dark roast coffee!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(103,47,'Erin Dougherty','erin-dougherty@quills-customer.com','','','2021-04-02 23:41:55','2021-04-02 23:41:55','This coffee took me back to visiting the Bourbon Trail and starting the morning at Quills. I highly recommend these coffee beans to kick off any day.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(104,47,'Jeff Schepper','jeff-schepper@quills-customer.com','','','2021-03-18 16:58:43','2021-03-18 16:58:43','Ok, but will revert back to Inkwell',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(105,47,'Marlow','marlow@quills-customer.com','','','2021-01-25 23:39:32','2021-01-25 23:39:32','I’ve tried my fair share of dark roasts around the city, but none of them hit the spot. Until I tasted this gem. Rich flavor and smoky after tones: exactly what I’ve been looking for for years. This is my new go-to and favorite coffee. Packs the punch I need in the morning!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(106,47,'Alex Stotts','alex-stotts@quills-customer.com','','','2021-01-09 12:31:18','2021-01-09 12:31:18','Quills does it again! As a Dark Roast lover, I was thrilled when the barista at my local Quills brought this new offering to my attention. Certainly not all Dark Roasts are created equal, and this one is top notch. It has the expected qualities of this roast level while maintaining some of the intricacies and delicate nuances many dark roasts miss!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(107,47,'Jamie Wiggins','jamie-wiggins@quills-customer.com','','','2020-12-06 04:05:11','2020-12-06 04:05:11','This is probably the best coffee I\'ve ever had. It is very dark, but if you like a dark roast it is delicious. I make it as an iced pour-over and it doesn\'t need the small splash of milk that most of my other coffees do. I have also bought beans for others',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(108,47,'William Kissel','william-kissel@quills-customer.com','','','2020-11-19 23:51:59','2020-11-19 23:51:59','I thought it was okay. Too “dark” for me compared to my favorite Central American varieties.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(109,50,'Lynn B','lynn-b@quills-customer.com','','','2025-10-21 15:21:13','2025-10-21 15:21:13','This is one of my favorite coffees I have ever had. The body is warm and comforting, with a natural spice and nuttiness that is perfect for a crisp morning or a cozy afternoon in! The fruitiness is more apple/pear on the front with a natural sweetness and weight on the middle with a pleasant warm finish. Truly a perfect cup for autumn.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(110,28,'Marcus K.','marcus@example.com','','','2026-10-18 06:25:25','2026-10-18 06:25:25','<strong>Excellent Burr Grinder</strong>\n\nThe Baratza Encore is incredible. Consistent grinds every time for my pour over!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(111,28,'Sarah P.','sarah@example.com','','','2026-10-18 06:25:34','2026-10-18 06:25:34','<strong>Best home grinder</strong>\n\nEasy to use and clean. Huge upgrade from my old blade grinder.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(112,29,'David L.','david-l@quills-customer.com','','','2026-09-15 08:22:00','2026-09-15 08:22:00','The 3-second heat-up is a game changer in the mornings. Steam power is shocking for a machine this size, pulls rich crema and velvety microfoam.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(113,29,'Jessica T.','jessica-t@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-02 16:45:00','2026-10-02 16:45:00','Perfect compact home espresso machine. Fits beautifully on the kitchen counter and produces genuine café quality espresso effortlessly.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(114,30,'Brian M.','brian-m@quills-customer.com','','','2026-09-20 09:10:00','2026-09-20 09:10:00','The thermal carafe keeps coffee hot without cooking it on a hotplate. SCA certified quality shines through every morning.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(115,30,'Elena R.','elena-r@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-05 11:30:00','2026-10-05 11:30:00','Outstanding drip brewer! Versatile brew options from Gold Cup to Cold Brew, and the carafe stays warm for hours.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(116,70,'Tyler B.','tyler-b@quills-customer.com','','','2026-09-18 11:20:00','2026-09-18 11:20:00','Super soft fleece and fits true to size. The evergreen color and owl embroidery are top notch!',0,'1','','review',0,0),
(117,70,'Hannah M.','hannah-m@quills-customer.com','','','2026-10-01 15:45:00','2026-10-01 15:45:00','One of my favorite sweatshirts now. Washes nicely without shrinking.',0,'1','','review',0,0),
