(163,31,'_wholesale_intro_heading','Hey there! I\'m Michael.'),
(164,31,'_wholesale_intro_lead','We want to help you build a cafe people love coming back to.'),
(165,31,'_wholesale_paragraph_1','After 19 years and seven cafes of our own, we know what a new owner needs from a coffee partner.'),
(166,31,'_wholesale_paragraph_2','You get coffee we serve in our own cafes, recipes and training for your baristas, and my personal cell for when you need a hand.'),
(167,31,'_wholesale_paragraph_3','Answer a few questions below to get your samples. I\'ll reach out to talk through your coffee program and arrange a free sample box.'),
