(28,0,'2026-10-13 05:42:36','2026-10-13 05:42:36','Here at Quills, we typically recommend folks begin their home coffee brewing by purchasing a quality grinder.\n\nThe Baratza Encore is a tried-and-true, easy-to-use burr grinder built for better coffee at home. With a wide range of grind settings, it handles everything from French press to pour-over and drip coffee, making it a great first grinder for anyone ready to move beyond pre-ground coffee.','Baratza Encore Grinder','Here at Quills, we typically recommend folks begin their home coffee brewing by purchasing a quality grinder.\n\nThe Baratza Encore is a tried-and-true, easy-to-use burr grinder built for better coffee at home. With a wide range of grind settings, it handles everything from French press to pour-over and drip coffee, making it a great first grinder for anyone ready to move beyond pre-ground coffee.','publish','open','closed','','baratza-encore-grinder','','','2026-10-18 06:28:18','2026-10-18 06:28:18','',0,'http://localhost:8000/?product=baratza-encore-grinder',1,'product','',2),
(29,0,'2026-10-13 05:42:36','2026-10-13 05:42:36','The Breville Bambino delivers barista-quality espresso in a compact, easy-to-use machine. Its 54mm portafilter holds an 18-gram dose for full flavor, while low-pressure pre-infusion and 9-bar extraction help produce balanced, consistent shots. A powerful manual steam wand creates silky microfoam ideal for latte art, and Breville’s ThermoJet heating system gets the machine ready to brew in just 3 seconds.','Breville Bambino Espresso Machine','The Breville Bambino delivers barista-quality espresso in a compact, easy-to-use machine. Its 54mm portafilter holds an 18-gram dose for full flavor, while low-pressure pre-infusion and 9-bar extraction help produce balanced, consistent shots. A powerful manual steam wand creates silky microfoam ideal for latte art, and Breville’s ThermoJet heating system gets the machine ready to brew in just 3 seconds.','publish','open','closed','','breville-bambino-espresso-machine','','','2026-10-18 06:28:18','2026-10-18 06:28:18','',0,'http://localhost:8000/?product=breville-bambino-espresso-machine',2,'product','',2),
(30,0,'2026-10-13 05:42:36','2026-10-13 05:42:36','Experience precision without complexity, delivering consistently great brews at the touch of a button. Simply select Brew and the machine does the rest, providing a perfect cup of coffee that meets SCA (Specialty Coffee Association) Golden Cup standards. Versatile brewing options include Cold Brew and even Custom settings, allowing you to set your own preferences.\n\nThe dual-wall thermal carafe keeps your brew hotter for longer (up to 4 hours) while the large capacity removable water tank is easy to fill. The included flat bottom and cone filter options make this the perfect brewer to suit a wide range of coffee making expertise and taste preferences.','Breville Luxe Brewer™ Thermal','Experience precision without complexity, delivering consistently great brews at the touch of a button. Simply select Brew and the machine does the rest, providing a perfect cup of coffee that meets SCA (Specialty Coffee Association) Golden Cup standards. Versatile brewing options include Cold Brew and even Custom settings, allowing you to set your own preferences.\n\nThe dual-wall thermal carafe keeps your brew hotter for longer (up to 4 hours) while the large capacity removable water tank is easy to fill. The included flat bottom and cone filter options make this the perfect brewer to suit a wide range of coffee making expertise and taste preferences.','publish','open','closed','','breville-luxe-brewer-thermal','','','2026-10-18 06:28:18','2026-10-18 06:28:18','',0,'http://localhost:8000/?product=breville-luxe-brewer-thermal',3,'product','',2),
